Because after all, what are we trying to track?

02:43.000 --> 02:44.480
We're trying to track stores of data.

02:44.480 --> 02:46.800
So what are we creating? We're creating a directory for stores.

02:46.800 --> 02:48.680
Why? Because when it comes to global state management,

02:48.680 --> 02:51.000
we're typically referred to as stores of the data,

02:51.000 --> 02:55.120
of the actions we need to take in order to make changes to those data stores.

